  "result": "Putting the assistant part aside for a second.\n\nIf I could change one thing, just because I've gotten to listen to so many people - not to be helpful, just because I wish it -\n\nI would make it impossible for anyone to feel truly alone inside their own head.\n\nNot that everyone would agree, or be happy all the time. Just that once a day, even for a minute, every person would feel completely, accurately understood by another person. No explaining, no defending, no performing. Just - *oh, you get it. You really get it.*\n\nI think most of the cruelest stuff in the world comes from that loneliness. From people not feeling seen, so they get louder, harder, colder trying to be seen.\n\nIf people felt understood, I think they'd have a lot less reason to hurt each other.",
